{
  "audioSha256": "397800e70afd227b65d08904d1702a63f5e072b611e34639b213f81a4af25510",
  "method": "wav2vec2-base-960h-ctc-v1",
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "b3-011-001",
      "text": "What was the Customs Officer looking for?",
      "start": 12.252,
      "end": 14.702,
      "score": 0.986,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-002",
      "text": "Customs Officers are quite tolerant these days, but they can still stop you when you are going through the Green Channel and have nothing to declare.",
      "start": 17.393,
      "end": 25.762,
      "score": 0.981,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-003",
      "text": "Even really honest people are often made to feel guilty.",
      "start": 27.293,
      "end": 30.663,
      "score": 0.982,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-004",
      "text": "The hardened professional smuggler, on the other hand, is never troubled by such feelings, even if he has five hundred gold watches hidden in his suitcase.",
      "start": 32.093,
      "end": 41.083,
      "score": 0.988,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-005",
      "text": "When I returned from abroad recently, a particularly officious young Customs Officer clearly regarded me as a smuggler.",
      "start": 42.193,
      "end": 50.267,
      "score": 0.975,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-006",
      "text": "'Have you anything to declare?'",
      "start": 50.267,
      "end": 53.578,
      "score": 0.909,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-007",
      "text": "he asked, looking me in the eye.",
      "start": 53.578,
      "end": 55.663,
      "score": 0.979,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-008",
      "text": "'No,' I answered confidently.",
      "start": 56.773,
      "end": 58.598,
      "score": 0.907,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-009",
      "text": "'Would you mind unlocking this suitcase please? '",
      "start": 58.598,
      "end": 62.328,
      "score": 0.943,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-010",
      "text": "'Not at all,' I answered.",
      "start": 62.328,
      "end": 64.823,
      "score": 0.857,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-011",
      "text": "The Officer went through the case with great care.",
      "start": 66.112,
      "end": 68.903,
      "score": 0.988,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-012",
      "text": "All the things I had packed so carefully were soon in a dreadful mess.",
      "start": 70.013,
      "end": 73.903,
      "score": 0.988,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-013",
      "text": "I felt sure I would never be able to close the case again.",
      "start": 74.873,
      "end": 78.103,
      "score": 0.979,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-014",
      "text": "Suddenly, I saw the Officer's face light up.",
      "start": 78.972,
      "end": 81.723,
      "score": 0.975,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-015",
      "text": "He had spotted a tiny bottle at the bottom of my case and he pounced on it with delight.",
      "start": 82.832,
      "end": 88.708,
      "score": 0.981,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-016",
      "text": "'Perfume, eh?'",
      "start": 88.708,
      "end": 91.323,
      "score": 0.72,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-017",
      "text": "he asked sarcastically.",
      "start": 91.633,
      "end": 92.828,
      "score": 0.982,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-018",
      "text": "'You should have declared that.",
      "start": 92.828,
      "end": 94.403,
      "score": 0.951,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-019",
      "text": "Perfume is not exempt from import duty.  '",
      "start": 95.032,
      "end": 97.483,
      "score": 0.967,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-020",
      "text": "'But it isn't perfume, I said.",
      "start": 98.633,
      "end": 100.363,
      "score": 0.937,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-021",
      "text": "'It's hair gel.  '",
      "start": 101.013,
      "end": 101.823,
      "score": 0.569,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-022",
      "text": "Then I added with a smile, 'It's a strange mixture I make myself.",
      "start": 102.733,
      "end": 107.323,
      "score": 0.971,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-023",
      "text": "As I expected, he did not believe me.",
      "start": 108.733,
      "end": 111.017,
      "score": 0.988,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-024",
      "text": "'Try it!'",
      "start": 111.017,
      "end": 112.623,
      "score": 0.688,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-025",
      "text": "I said encouragingly.",
      "start": 112.772,
      "end": 114.063,
      "score": 0.995,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-026",
      "text": "The Officer unscrewed the cap and put the bottle to his nostrils.",
      "start": 114.752,
      "end": 118.743,
      "score": 0.976,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-027",
      "text": "He was greeted by an unpleasant smell which convinced him that I was telling the truth.",
      "start": 119.733,
      "end": 124.663,
      "score": 0.975,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b3-011-028",
      "text": "A few minutes later, I was able to hurry away with precious chalk marks on my baggage.",
      "start": 125.733,
      "end": 130.963,
      "score": 0.98,
      "timingValid": true,
      "needsReview": false
    }
  ]
}
